From: Bryan Roscoe <bryanroscoe@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 25 Oct 2026 22:26:13 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] Parser: keep unsupported history readings explicit

Withdraw live-control substitution for historical entry control and source-only grouping for a source-to-recipient damage maximum. Cover the existing strict gap paths and supported siblings, and apply two neutral clippy suggestions.
